From 92041af695e5004c5c55212eadc1e3a0cbe2313e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 20:06:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Git Sync agent and macOS dashboard integration

New Python agent (git_sync.py) that monitors git repos and auto-generates
Obsidian changelogs and living product docs from commits via Claude AI.
Extends the existing Agent framework with CLI subcommands: list, add,
remove, sync, sync-all.

Adds a dedicated Git Sync tab to the macOS manager app with project cards,
add/remove/sync controls, enable/disable toggles, and live output console.

https://claude.ai/code/session_018PqZMGQbhPUgy9mkW8WRE6
